{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10609002","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10609002","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1060900201:0":{"text":"世界中の珍宝や一点物がより取り見取り！キースのお宝部屋へようこそ！","source_cn":"欢迎来到基斯的奇珍屋！这里汇聚了世界各地的珍奇宝物和独...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E41816DEBCAD153","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1060900202:1":{"text":"キースのお宝部屋では、他では見つけられない商品をメインに取り扱っています。","source_cn":"奇珍屋致力于为您带来无法在其他地方找到的独特商品和礼品。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DF3C56A85FADC3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1060900203:1":{"text":"お客様が当店でお探しの宝物を見つけ、素敵な思い出を作っていただけることを願っています。","source_cn":"希望您在这里找到心仪的宝物，并留下美好的回忆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5C049ED61CC0FCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:基斯":{"text":"キース","source":"基斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}